<div class="container">
  <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #e74c3c;">Web Components in Rails Demo</h1>
  <p>このデモでは、Ruby on Rails環境で5つの異なるWeb Componentsを使用しています。</p>

  <h2 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Counter Components</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
    <my-counter count="0"></my-counter>
    <react-counter count="0"></react-counter>
    <lit-counter count="0"></lit-counter>
    <lit-tailwind-counter count="0"></lit-tailwind-counter>
    <preact-counter count="0"></preact-counter>
    <svelte-counter count="0"></svelte-counter>
  </div>

  <h2 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Modal Components</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
    <vanilla-modal></vanilla-modal>
    <react-modal></react-modal>
    <lit-modal></lit-modal>
    <lit-tailwind-modal></lit-tailwind-modal>
    <preact-modal></preact-modal>
    <svelte-modal></svelte-modal>
  </div>

  <h2 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Button Components</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
    <vanilla-button label="Vanilla Button"></vanilla-button>
    <react-button label="React Button"></react-button>
    <lit-button label="Lit Button"></lit-button>
    <lit-tailwind-button label="Tailwind Button"></lit-tailwind-button>
    <preact-button label="Preact Button"></preact-button>
    <svelte-button label="Svelte Button"></svelte-button>
  </div>

  <h2 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Toggle Components</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
    <lit-tailwind-toggle></lit-tailwind-toggle>
  </div>

  <h2 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Dropdown Components</h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
    <vanilla-dropdown
      options='[{"label": "Option 1", "value": "1"}, {"label": "Option 2", "value": "2"}, {"label": "Option 3", "value": "3"}]'
      placeholder="Vanilla Dropdown"
    ></vanilla-dropdown>
    <react-dropdown
      options='[{"label": "React", "value": "react"}, {"label": "Svelte", "value": "svelte"}, {"label": "Vue", "value": "vue"}]'
      placeholder="React Dropdown"
    ></react-dropdown>
    <lit-dropdown
      options='[{"label": "Lit", "value": "lit"}, {"label": "Fast", "value": "fast"}, {"label": "Stencil", "value": "stencil"}]'
      placeholder="Lit Dropdown"
    ></lit-dropdown>
    <lit-tailwind-dropdown
      options='[{"label": "Tailwind", "value": "tailwind"}, {"label": "Bootstrap", "value": "bootstrap"}, {"label": "Material", "value": "material"}]'
      placeholder="Tailwind Dropdown"
    ></lit-tailwind-dropdown>
    <preact-dropdown
      options='[{"label": "Preact", "value": "preact"}, {"label": "React", "value": "react"}, {"label": "Inferno", "value": "inferno"}]'
      placeholder="Preact Dropdown"
    ></preact-dropdown>
    <svelte-dropdown
      options='[{"label": "Svelte", "value": "svelte"}, {"label": "SolidJS", "value": "solid"}, {"label": "Qwik", "value": "qwik"}]'
      placeholder="Svelte Dropdown"
    ></svelte-dropdown>
  </div>

  <h2 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 1rem;">iframe Test (Cross-Origin)</h2>
  <p>
    以下のiframeは別のポート（4001）で動作するiframe-serverからコンポーネントを読み込んでいます。<br />
    クロスオリジン環境でのWeb Componentsの動作を確認できます。
  </p>
  <div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(155, 89, 182, 0.05); border-radius: 8px;">
    <iframe
      src="http://localhost:4001/all"
      width="100%"
      height="600"
      style="border: 2px solid rgba(155, 89, 182, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; display: block; width: 100%;"
      title="iframe test - all components"
    ></iframe>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.1); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.3);">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #e74c3c;">使い方</h3>
    <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); text-align: left; margin: 0.5rem 0;">各カウンターの + / - ボタンをクリックして、カウンターを操作できます。</p>
    <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); text-align: left; margin: 0.5rem 0;">RailsのERBテンプレート内で、HTMLタグとして直接Web Componentsを使用できます。</p>
    <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); text-align: left; margin: 0.5rem 0;">フレームワークに依存しないため、任意のRailsアプリケーションに簡単に組み込めます。</p>
    <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); text-align: left; margin: 0.5rem 0;">
      <strong>iframe-serverを起動する:</strong> プロジェクトルートで <code>mise iframe-server</code> を実行してください。
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
